# Third-party checkouts stay local. A text result too large to version gets its own line below.
**/sources/


# New experiment outputs are generated; promote only compact evidence deliberately.
/outputs/

# Date-stamped Astra batch workspaces stay local; promote winning evidence explicitly.
evidence/local/astra300_*/

# CPU100 run folders keep only their hand-maintained result summary in Git.
evidence/local/cpu100_*/
!evidence/local/cpu100_*/
evidence/local/cpu100_*/**
!evidence/local/cpu100_*/METHODS_AND_FAILURES.md

